  "answer_text": "Here is some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- **\"Still in Love With You\"** is a **1991 song** by Brooks & Dunn from the album **Brand New Man**.\n\n- It is the **tenth track** on the *Brand New Man* album.\n\nThe song is a classic country ballad about a man who, despite leaving a relationship, can't shake his feelings for someone. The narrator imagines escaping \u2014 on a horse, with wings, or through dreams \u2014 but no matter what, he always wakes up still in love. It features the memorable chorus line: *\"But I'd wake up still in love with you.\"*\n\nYou can listen to it on [Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/track/5nTh5z1Uac2istxVmX3qH8) or watch it on [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iyk_dM9CbUY).\n\nWould you like to know more about the song, the album, or Brooks & Dunn in general?",
